{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa66fadfef5bd6e4540f3b7b0090c8b737dddba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (x-y) \\cos y + \\cos (x-y) \\sin y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"259\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/669dfe235c2ec80f02b92c773f03d0c7461dead0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sin x\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\cos x\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\sin x \\cos 2y\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\cos x\\cos 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"569\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the addition formula for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb300dacfcde1b57ad070409262b1743e0cd966.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" />, this becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/f/acff63194c1752699ab339225999b1af12a45834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{((x-y)+y)} = \\sin{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Pro